One of the new products that we <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/26/apple-teases-a-big-week-ahead/">could see next week</a> is a refreshed version of the low-cost <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad/">iPad</a>. As with <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/24/m4-ipad-air-latest-rumors/">the iPad Air</a>, we're not expecting major changes, but it is expected to get some meaningful internal upgrades.<br/>
<br/>
